(# AMAN Codex Chat Handoff) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (This document is a shareable handoff compiled from the Codex session history available in) Tj
T* (this workspace. It is intended to give another user or another Codex session enough) Tj
T* (context to continue the project with similar understanding.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## Important note) Tj
T* (- This is not an official platform-level export of the full Codex conversation UI.) Tj
T* (- It is a structured handoff built from the session context and project work.) Tj
T* (- For continuity, this document should be shared together with the codebase.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## Project identity) Tj
T* (- Project name: AMAN) Tj
T* (- Main mobile app path: `AMAN/mobile_app`) Tj
T* (- Admin web path: `AMAN/admin_web`) Tj
T* (- Backend: Supabase) Tj
T* (- Mobile stack: Flutter) Tj
T* (- Admin stack: React + Vite + Supabase) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## Core architecture) Tj
T* (### Authentication) Tj
T* (- Supabase Auth stores real credentials using email and password.) Tj
T* (- The app also uses a `public.user` table to store business profile data:) Tj
T* (  - `user_id`) Tj
T* (  - `email`) Tj
T* (  - `username`) Tj
T* (  - `role`) Tj
T* (  - `full_name`) Tj
T* (  - `phone`) Tj
T* (  - `id_number`) Tj
T* (- Login uses username in the UI, then looks up the email from `public.user`, then signs in) Tj
T* ( to Supabase Auth using email and password.) Tj
T* (- Registration creates the Supabase auth user first, then upserts profile data into) Tj
T* (`public.user`.) Tj
T* (- Role-based navigation sends `owner` to owner home and all others to seeker home.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### Property management) Tj
T* (- Owner add/update/delete is handled via page -> controller -> repository.) Tj
T* (- Property rows are stored in `properties`.) Tj
T* (- Property images are stored in `property_images` and the files themselves are stored in) Tj
T* (the Supabase storage bucket `property-images`.) Tj
T* (- Certificates are stored in the Supabase storage bucket `property-certificates`.) Tj
T* (- Add property flow:) Tj
T* (  1. Validate form) Tj
T* (  2. Upload certificate) Tj
T* (  3. Insert property row) Tj
T* (  4. Upload property images) Tj
T* (  5. Insert property image rows) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
