T* (  4. Insert those new image rows) Tj
T* (- Delete property flow:) Tj
T* (  1. Confirm in UI) Tj
T* (  2. Remove property image files from storage) Tj
T* (  3. Remove leftover files under the property folder path) Tj
T* (  4. Remove certificate file) Tj
T* (  5. Delete property row) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### Seeker behavior) Tj
T* (- Seeker home shows active properties from the database.) Tj
T* (- Search uses RPC-backed property filtering.) Tj
T* (- Property details page supports images and location navigation.) Tj
T* (- Guests can browse/search/view details but other actions require login.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### Recommendation / wished property) Tj
T* (- The recommendation feature is used when the seeker does not find the property they want.) Tj
T* (- The seeker saves desired property criteria into `wished_property`.) Tj
T* (- A notification/matching flow was built to match wishes against properties.) Tj
T* (- Exact SQL matching existed before and was later disabled while testing AI matching.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### Messaging and deals) Tj
T* (- Contact from property cards opens the relevant owner/seeker chat.) Tj
T* (- Chat behavior, unread messages, and deal completion were implemented over multiple) Tj
T* (iterations.) Tj
T* (- Deals can drive property status changes to inactive after completion.) Tj
T* (- Ratings were discussed and wired after deal completion, with several database) Tj
T* (adjustments along the way.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## Admin dashboard) Tj
T* (- A separate admin web project was created under `AMAN/admin_web`.) Tj
T* (- Stack: React + Vite + Supabase.) Tj
T* (- Supabase connection is provided through a `.env` file using:) Tj
T* (  - `VITE_SUPABASE_URL`) Tj
T* (  - `VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`) Tj
T* (- The admin dashboard includes a login flow and real counts pulled from Supabase.) Tj
T* (- Hosting recommendation was to use Vercel, Netlify, or Cloudflare Pages rather than) Tj
T* (trying to host the React site directly on Supabase.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## Major chronological history) Tj
T* (Below is a chronological summary of the main requests, fixes, and architectural decisions) Tj
T* (made during this session history.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### 1. Profile and edit pages) Tj
T* (- Edit information page and profile flow were built/refined.) Tj
ET
